I myself does not have a sparc machine, but a tester
reported that now the Linux Super Page patch is working on sparc64.

He reported me that it speedup Ultra-II-300MHz as 2.2 times on a
large matrix transpose benchmark.
(I got 4 to 5 times speedups on Alpha, though)

Anyone wants to try the kernel patch against 2.4.18, see:

